2. Added `public func parseNote(from text: String) throws -> Note` (lines 22-41)

**Logic:**
- Splits `text` on the literal separator `"\n---\n"`
- Guards that exactly 4 parts exist; throws `NoteParseError.malformedFormat` otherwise
- Parts map to: `[0]` → id, `[1]` → title, `[2]` → pinned (`"1"` → true, anything else → false), `[3]` → body
- Tags are extracted from `body` via the existing `extractTags(from:)` — no tag logic duplicated


